/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (This booklet is part of a project dedicated to increasing awareness of inherited genetic disorders in Pakistan and promoting early recognition of symptoms in children. It has been designed for child care workers, parents, and caregivers to provide simple, practical information about common genetic disorders, their early warning signs, and when medical attention may be needed. Through greater awareness and early intervention, we hope to help every child receive the care and support they deserve.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
