90 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (Having an inherited genetic disorder does not mean that anyone did something wrong. These conditions are caused by the way genes are naturally passed through families.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
